{
  "quest.487ADC716E648EC3.quest_desc": [
    "Using the FTB Map, you can claim the land around you to prevent players or mob griefing.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"Press \", {\"keybind\": \"key.ftbchunks.keys.map\", \"color\": \"yellow\", \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Default: M\"}}, \" to open the map, then \", {\"text\": \"C\", \"color\": \"aqua\"}, \" for the claim screen. Drag with the left mouse button over chunks to claim them. Holding the right mouse button will unclaim them.\"]",
    "",
    "Once claimed, other players can't build or break blocks in your claims unless they are &bAllies&r. You can also change this setting if needed.",
    "",
    "You can claim up to 500 chunks by default. A team's shared limit is the largest individual claim allowance among its members, including any extra chunks granted to that player. Team members' allowances are not added together.",
  ],
  "quest.7288363970514CAF.quest_desc": [
    "Found something that doesn't work like it should? We'd love to know so we can fix it!",
    "",
    "[ \"You can stop by to let us know on \", { \"text\": \"Discord\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": { \"url\": \"https://discord.com/invite/X5UGvBs\", \"action\": \"open_url\" }, \"hover_event\": { \"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": [ \"Open Discord invite\" ] } }, \" or by making a bug report on \", { \"text\": \"GitHub\", \"color\": \"light_purple\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/FTBTeam/FTB-Modpack-Issues/issues\" }, \"hover_event\": { \"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": [ \"Open FTB GitHub\" ] } }, \".\" ]",
  ],
  "quest.4EB51007596CFD80.title": "&aUseful Commands",
  "quest.12894F0E1F127011.quest_desc": [
    "Open your inventory and click the &bFTB Teams&r button to create or manage a team and invite friends. You can also create one with &b/ftbteams party create <name>&r.",
    "",
    "You'll need to invite friends with &b/ftbteams party invite <player>&r. They accept with &b/ftbteams party join <team>&r.",
    "",
    "A team shares quest progress, land claims, chunk-loading limits, and shop progress. Coins stay with each player.",
    "",
    "Joining a team moves your claims to it. If you leave, you get your original claims back.",
  ],
  "quest.5EFEE20886FA69C9.title": "&6The Spawn Pyramid",
  "quest.1B8C4F705A05CED9.quest_desc": [
    "Most quests pay a few &6coins&r. You can see your balance in your inventory screen.",
    "",
    "Coins can be spent at &6Shopkeepers&r that are spread across the world. Each one can spawn in a different place, such as a village, tavern, manor, mage tower, witch hut or ship.",
    "",
    "Travel to one of those places and its shopkeepers arrive! Right-click one with an empty hand to trade.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"The \", {\"text\": \"Vendors\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"4E77F883F5F8C4E7\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to the Exploration chapter\"}}, \" section of the Exploration chapter lists every shopkeeper and where to look.\"]",
    "",
    "Coins belong to you, not your team. &b/coins pay&r sends some to another player.",
  ],
  "quest.6FFB8100C9A1B5AF.quest_desc": [
    "&2Evolution 2&r is a kitchensink style pack that has mods for every type of player, as well as a Quest Book to guide them through every step of the way.",
    "",
    "The &eQuest Book&r is a guide, not a gate. Every mod works from the moment you arrive, so open any chapter that you want to get started.",
    "",
    "This chapter covers what the pack adds on top of its mods, such as the Pyramid you started in, coins and shops, land claims, teams and a few commands.",
  ],
  "quest.5EFEE20886FA69C9.quest_desc": [
    "You start inside a floating &aPyramid&r high above world spawn.",
    "",
    "Standing in it gives you Slow Falling, so any time that you want to leave, just jump!",
    "",
    "The land around the pyramid is claimed, so you can't build or destroy anything.",
    "",
    "&6The Broker&r also keeps a shop at the pyramid with starter supplies, if you'd like to check them out.",
  ],
  "quest.69927955906999B1.title": "&aChunk Loading",
  "task.7F31A6D144C9F3CA.title": "Found A Bug?",
  "quest.3AD1F60EDA4BCA7E.title": "&6Feed The Beast",
  "quest.487ADC716E648EC3.title": "&aClaiming Land",
  "quest.4EB51007596CFD80.quest_desc": [
    "- &b/home&r: Teleports you to your set Home. Set with /sethome. Limit 1, 60s cooldown.",
    "",
    "- &b/back&r: Teleports to where you last teleported or died. 60s cooldown.",
    "",
    "- &b/spawn&r: Teleports back to the pyramid. 60s cooldown.",
    "",
    "- &b/tpa <player>&r: Requests to teleport to another player. 2 minute cooldown.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "- &b/rtp&r: Teleports to a random spot 500 to 2,500 blocks away. Each player can use it every 100 seconds, only one player every 200 seconds. Does not work in the end.",
    "",
    "- &b/trashcan&r: Opens a trashcan to throw your items away in.",
  ],
  "quest.3AD1F60EDA4BCA7E.quest_desc": [
    "Ten &aChallenge Boards&r stand on the pyramid's terrace. They rank the top ten teams by how much of the &6Feed The Beast Progress&r chapter each has finished, and update every minute. Right-click a board to open that chapter.",
    "",
    "To climb the boards, build an &aFTB Skyline&r of your own. Each challenge asks for items, fluids or power. Pipe items into the north and south bays, fluids into the west and energy into the east, then press &bLaunch&r.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"Start with the \", {\"text\": \"FTB Fabricator\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"524F093A735BE7DD\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to the FTB Skyline quest\"}}, \" quest.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.69927955906999B1.quest_desc": [
    "You can &aChunk Load&r your claims using the FTB Map as well.",
    "",
    "Hold &bShift&r and drag with the left mouse button on the claim screen to force-load chunks, so machines keep running while you are away. &bSneak + Right-clicking&r  stops it. You can force-load up to 25 chunks by default.",
    "",
    "&aNote&r: Force-loaded chunks only stay loaded while someone on your team is online.",
  ],
  "quest.6FFB8100C9A1B5AF.title": "&6Welcome to FTB Evolution 2",
  "quest.12894F0E1F127011.title": "&bPlaying Together",
  "quest.1B8C4F705A05CED9.title": "&6Coins and Shops",
}